cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite the article given under preferred-citation."
type: software
title: "MPC with state estimation versus PI and deep reinforcement learning for unsteady flow regulation in the South Mirzachul main canal: code, data and results"
abstract: >-
  Saint-Venant model of the 123.7-km South Mirzachul main canal (Uzbekistan) built from its
  passport, offset-free model predictive control with a Kalman filter that uses only SCADA
  measurements, a full-state MPC, a tuned PI, and PPO/TD3 agents (pure and residual) implemented
  in NumPy, with all trained agents, evaluation results and figures. Code: MIT licence; data,
  results and figures: CC BY 4.0 (see LICENSE-DATA.md).
